# prefix-block-mixed-values

## Input

```mical
block.
  str hello world
  num 42
  flag true
  neg -1
  quoted "value"
  text |
    multi
    line

```

## JSON

```json
{
  "block.str": "hello world",
  "block.num": 42,
  "block.flag": true,
  "block.neg": -1,
  "block.quoted": "value",
  "block.text": "multi\nline\n"
}
```

vim:ft=markdown
